* 3D mode 2 along (0,1,-1) (normalised twice): die 1 lifted 5, then moved along the diagonal until contact; displacement = w*d, w = (0, 0.7071.., -0.7071..)
* ORACLE: die 1 moved by (0, 5, -5) (d = 7.0711 along w), net (0, 5, 0) after the lift; CNTRAX/CNTRA2 move with it.
KFREAD 0
UPSET_Brick.KEY
OBJPOS 1 1 0 0 5
OBJPOS 1 2 0.0 0 1 -1 2 0 0 0
KFWRIT
OUT.KEY
